{"id":"npc:%E8%89%BE%E5%B0%94%E7%93%A6","profile":[{"title":"人物简介","text":"整合运动成员，作为信使活动。原哥伦比亚提卡伦多人，在经历让芬等人感染的天灾后离开城市，最终加入整合运动。曾为夏栎传递过情报信息，被其称为“逐尘者”。","spoiler":true,"source":"活动剧情叮咚作响。"}],"artCandidates":[{"kind":"avg","url":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6b/Avg_avg_npc_333_1$1.png","verified":true,"spoiler":true,"thumbnailUrl":"https://media.prts.wiki/thumb/6/6b/Avg_avg_npc_333_1$1.png/240px-Avg_avg_npc_333_1$1.png"}],"appearances":[{"story":"activities/act10mini/level_act10mini_st06","lineCount":22,"snippets":[{"commandIndex":127,"line":128,"speaker":"艾尔瓦","text":"早上好，Guard先生。"},{"commandIndex":137,"line":138,"speaker":"艾尔瓦","text":"大部分拓荒区的感染者生活都不容易，我们能提供的帮助非常有限。"},{"commandIndex":656,"line":657,"speaker":"艾尔瓦","text":"……坎诺特先生，你还记得我吗？"}]}]}